96
00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:33.556
State validation rejects malformed
structures and Boolean budget values

97
00:08:33.556 --> 00:08:37.778
immediately. The plain integer helper uses
exact type identity, excluding

98
00:08:37.778 --> 00:08:42.000
Booleans. This matters because Python
makes True compare equal to

99
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:46.222
one. Proposal validation checks exact
keys, primitive types, formats, and

100
00:08:46.222 --> 00:08:50.444
ranges. Approval validation applies those
