107
00:09:15.778 --> 00:09:20.000
balance afterward.

108
00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:24.222
Save the complete canonical code unchanged
as agents_lab.py locally. Run

109
00:09:24.222 --> 00:09:28.444
it using Python three without installing
additional packages first. The

110
00:09:28.444 --> 00:09:32.667
script uses copying, assertions, printing,
JSON, and regular expressions. It

111
00:09:32.667 --> 00:09:36.889
