135
00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:18.222
Thirty corrected checks cover denials and
already-complete or invalid-state

136
00:11:18.222 --> 00:11:22.444
behavior. Three bug-proof checks
independently expose the intentional

137
00:11:22.444 --> 00:11:26.667
executor defects clearly. Five recovery
checks cover repetition, reconciliation,

138
00:11:26.667 --> 00:11:30.889
budgets, and unresolved uncertainty. Typed
probes reject None, lists, dictionaries,

139
00:11:30.889 --> 00:11:35.111
and Boolean numeric fields. One probe
